{"id":"reference/Values","kind":"langref","title":"值","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Values","file":"reference/Values.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Values","text":"值"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Primitive-Types","text":"基本类型"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Primitive-Values","text":"基本值"},{"depth":3,"slug":"String-Literals-and-Unicode-Code-Point-Literals","text":"字符串字面量与 Unicode 码点字面量"},{"depth":4,"slug":"Escape-Sequences","text":"转义序列"},{"depth":4,"slug":"Multiline-String-Literals","text":"多行字符串字面量"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Assignment","text":"赋值"},{"depth":4,"slug":"undefined","text":"undefined"},{"depth":4,"slug":"Destructuring","text":"解构"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Values\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#Values\">值</a></h2>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">values.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-comment\">// 顶层声明与顺序无关：</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> print = std.debug.print;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> os = std.os;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> assert = std.debug.assert;\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 自定义错误集合定义：</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ExampleErrorSet = <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>{\n    ExampleErrorVariant,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 整数</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> one_plus_one: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> + <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"1 + 1 = {}\\n\"</span>, .{one_plus_one});\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 浮点数</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> seven_div_three: <span class=\"tok-type\">f32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">7.0</span> / <span class=\"tok-number\">3.0</span>;\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"7.0 / 3.0 = {}\\n\"</span>, .{seven_div_three});\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 布尔值</span>\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"{}\\n{}\\n{}\\n\"</span>, .{\n        <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">and</span> <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">or</span> <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span>,\n        !<span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>,\n    });\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可选值</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> optional_value: ?[]<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">null</span>;\n    assert(optional_value == <span class=\"tok-null\">null</span>);\n\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"\\noptional 1\\ntype: {}\\nvalue: {?s}\\n\"</span>, .{\n        <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(optional_value), optional_value,\n    });\n\n    optional_value = <span class=\"tok-str\">\"hi\"</span>;\n    assert(optional_value != <span class=\"tok-null\">null</span>);\n\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"\\noptional 2\\ntype: {}\\nvalue: {?s}\\n\"</span>, .{\n        <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(optional_value), optional_value,\n    });\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 错误联合</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> number_or_error: ExampleErrorSet!<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = ExampleErrorSet.ExampleErrorVariant;\n\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"\\nerror union 1\\ntype: {}\\nvalue: {!}\\n\"</span>, .{\n        <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(number_or_error),\n        number_or_error,\n    });\n\n    number_or_error = <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\n\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"\\nerror union 2\\ntype: {}\\nvalue: {!}\\n\"</span>, .{\n        <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(number_or_error), number_or_error,\n    });\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe values.zig</kbd>\n$ <kbd>./values</kbd>\n1 + 1 = 2\n7.0 / 3.0 = 2.3333333\nfalse\ntrue\nfalse\n\noptional 1\ntype: ?[]const u8\nvalue: null\n\noptional 2\ntype: ?[]const u8\nvalue: hi\n\nerror union 1\ntype: error{ExampleErrorVariant}!i32\nvalue: error.ExampleErrorVariant\n\nerror union 2\ntype: error{ExampleErrorVariant}!i32\nvalue: 1234\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <h3 id=\"Primitive-Types\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#Primitive-Types\">基本类型</a></h3>\n\n      <div class=\"table-wrapper\">\n      <table>\n        <caption>基本类型</caption>\n        <thead>\n            <tr>\n            <th scope=\"col\">类型</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">C 对应类型</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">说明</th>\n        </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">int8_t</code></td>\n          <td>8 位有符号整数</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">uint8_t</code></td>\n          <td>8 位无符号整数</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">i16</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">int16_t</code></td>\n          <td>16 位有符号整数</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">u16</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">uint16_t</code></td>\n          <td>16 位无符号整数</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">int32_t</code></td>\n          <td>32 位有符号整数</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">uint32_t</code></td>\n          <td>32 位无符号整数</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">i64</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">int64_t</code></td>\n          <td>64 位有符号整数</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">uint64_t</code></td>\n          <td>64 位无符号整数</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">i128</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">__int128</code></td>\n          <td>128 位有符号整数</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">u128</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">unsigned __int128</code></td>\n          <td>128 位无符号整数</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">isize</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">intptr_t</code>, <code class=\"c\">ssize_t</code></td>\n          <td>与指针等宽的有符号整数</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">uintptr_t</code>, <code class=\"c\">size_t</code></td>\n          <td>与指针等宽的无符号整数。另见 <a href=\"https://github.com/ziglang/zig/issues/5185\">#5185</a></td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_char</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">char</code></td>\n          <td>用于兼容 C ABI</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_short</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">short</code></td>\n          <td>用于兼容 C ABI</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_ushort</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">unsigned short</code></td>\n          <td>用于兼容 C ABI</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_int</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">int</code></td>\n          <td>用于兼容 C ABI</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_uint</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">unsigned int</code></td>\n          <td>用于兼容 C ABI</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_long</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">long</code></td>\n          <td>用于兼容 C ABI</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_ulong</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">unsigned long</code></td>\n          <td>用于兼容 C ABI</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_longlong</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">long long</code></td>\n          <td>用于兼容 C ABI</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_ulonglong</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">unsigned long long</code></td>\n          <td>用于兼容 C ABI</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_longdouble</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">long double</code></td>\n          <td>用于兼容 C ABI</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">f16</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">_Float16</code></td>\n          <td>16 位浮点数（10 位尾数），IEEE-754-2008 binary16</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">f32</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">float</code></td>\n          <td>32 位浮点数（23 位尾数），IEEE-754-2008 binary32</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">f64</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">double</code></td>\n          <td>64 位浮点数（52 位尾数），IEEE-754-2008 binary64</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">f80</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">long double</code></td>\n          <td>80 位浮点数（64 位尾数），IEEE-754-2008 八十位扩展精度</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">f128</span></code></th>\n            <td><code class=\"c\">_Float128</code></td>\n          <td>128 位浮点数（112 位尾数），IEEE-754-2008 binary128</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">bool</code></td>\n          <td><code><span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code> 或 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">false</span></code></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">anyopaque</span></code></th>\n          <td><code class=\"c\">void</code></td>\n          <td>用于类型擦除指针。</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">noreturn</span></code></th>\n          <td>（无）</td>\n          <td><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span></code>、<code><span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span></code>、<code><span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span></code>、<code><span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span></code> 和 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (<span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>) {}</code> 的类型</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">type</span></code></th>\n          <td>（无）</td>\n          <td>类型本身的类型</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">anyerror</span></code></th>\n          <td>（无）</td>\n          <td>错误码</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">comptime_int</span></code></th>\n          <td>（无）</td>\n          <td>仅允许用于<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>已知的值。整数字面量的类型。</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-type\">comptime_float</span></code></th>\n          <td>（无）</td>\n          <td>仅允许用于<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>已知的值。浮点数字面量的类型。</td>\n        </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n      </div>\n      <p>除上述整数类型外，还可以使用字母 <code>i</code> 或 <code>u</code> 后接数字的标识符引用任意位宽整数。例如，标识符 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">i7</span></code> 表示七位有符号整数。整数类型允许的最大位宽为 <code><span class=\"tok-number\">65535</span></code>。</p>\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floats\">浮点数</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Zero-Bit-Types/#void\">void</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Errors\">错误</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#Int\">@Int</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n      <h3 id=\"Primitive-Values\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#Primitive-Values\">基本值</a></h3>\n\n      <div class=\"table-wrapper\">\n      <table>\n        <caption>基本值</caption>\n        <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"col\">名称</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">说明</th>\n        </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code> 和 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">false</span></code></th>\n            <td><code><span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span></code> 类型的值</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-null\">null</span></code></th>\n            <td>用于将可选类型的值设为 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">null</span></code></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code><span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span></code></th>\n          <td>用于让值保持未指定状态</td>\n        </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n      </div>\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#Optionals\">可选值</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#undefined\">undefined</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n      <h3 id=\"String-Literals-and-Unicode-Code-Point-Literals\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#String-Literals-and-Unicode-Code-Point-Literals\">字符串字面量与 Unicode 码点字面量</a></h3>\n\n      <p>字符串字面量是指向以空字节终止的字节数组的常量单项<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Pointers/#Pointers\">指针</a>。字符串字面量的类型同时包含长度和以空字节终止这一信息，因此既可以<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Type-Coercion\">强制转换</a>为<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Slices/#Slices\">切片</a>，也可以转换为<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Pointers/#Sentinel-Terminated-Pointers\">空字节终止指针</a>。对字符串字面量解引用会得到<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Arrays/#Arrays\">数组</a>。</p>\n      <p>由于 Zig 源码采用 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Source-Encoding/#Source-Encoding\">UTF-8 编码</a>，源码中字符串字面量内出现的非 ASCII 字节会以原本的 UTF-8 含义进入 Zig 程序的字符串内容；编译器不会修改这些字节。使用 <code>\\xNN</code> 写法还可以在字符串字面量中嵌入非 UTF-8 字节。</p>\n      <p>对含有非 ASCII 字节的字符串执行索引，返回的是单个字节，无论该字节是否构成有效 UTF-8。</p>\n      <p>Unicode 码点字面量的类型是 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">comptime_int</span></code>，与<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integer-Literals\">整数字面量</a>相同。所有<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#Escape-Sequences\">转义序列</a>都既适用于字符串字面量，也适用于 Unicode 码点字面量。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">string_literals.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> print = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).debug.print;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> mem = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).mem; <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 将用于比较字节</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> bytes = <span class=\"tok-str\">\"hello\"</span>;\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"{}\\n\"</span>, .{<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(bytes)}); <span class=\"tok-comment\">// *const [5:0]u8</span>\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"{d}\\n\"</span>, .{bytes.len}); <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 5</span>\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"{c}\\n\"</span>, .{bytes[<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>]}); <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 'e'</span>\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"{d}\\n\"</span>, .{bytes[<span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>]}); <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 0</span>\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"{}\\n\"</span>, .{<span class=\"tok-str\">'e'</span> == <span class=\"tok-str\">'\\x65'</span>}); <span class=\"tok-comment\">// true</span>\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"{d}\\n\"</span>, .{<span class=\"tok-str\">'\\u{1f4a9}'</span>}); <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 128169</span>\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"{d}\\n\"</span>, .{<span class=\"tok-str\">'💯'</span>}); <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 128175</span>\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"{u}\\n\"</span>, .{<span class=\"tok-str\">'⚡'</span>});\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"{}\\n\"</span>, .{mem.eql(<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-str\">\"hello\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-str\">\"h\\x65llo\"</span>)}); <span class=\"tok-comment\">// true</span>\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"{}\\n\"</span>, .{mem.eql(<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-str\">\"💯\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-str\">\"\\xf0\\x9f\\x92\\xaf\"</span>)}); <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 同样为 true</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> invalid_utf8 = <span class=\"tok-str\">\"\\xff\\xfe\"</span>; <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用 \\xNN 写法可以表示非 UTF-8 字符串。</span>\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"0x{x}\\n\"</span>, .{invalid_utf8[<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>]}); <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 对它们索引返回单个字节……</span>\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"0x{x}\\n\"</span>, .{<span class=\"tok-str\">\"💯\"</span>[<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>]}); <span class=\"tok-comment\">// ……即使索引位于非 ASCII 字符的中间也是如此</span>\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe string_literals.zig</kbd>\n$ <kbd>./string_literals</kbd>\n*const [5:0]u8\n5\ne\n0\ntrue\n128169\n128175\n⚡\ntrue\ntrue\n0xfe\n0x9f\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Arrays/#Arrays\">数组</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Source-Encoding/#Source-Encoding\">源码编码</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      <h4 id=\"Escape-Sequences\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#Escape-Sequences\">转义序列</a></h4>\n\n      <div class=\"table-wrapper\">\n      <table>\n        <caption>转义序列</caption>\n        <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"col\">转义序列</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">名称</th>\n        </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code>\\n</code></th>\n          <td>换行</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code>\\r</code></th>\n          <td>回车</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code>\\t</code></th>\n          <td>制表符</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code>\\\\</code></th>\n          <td>反斜杠</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code>\\'</code></th>\n          <td>单引号</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code>\\\"</code></th>\n          <td>双引号</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code>\\xNN</code></th>\n          <td>十六进制的八位字节值（两位数字）</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><code>\\u{NNNNNN}</code></th>\n          <td>十六进制 Unicode 标量值，以 UTF-8 编码（至少一位数字）</td>\n        </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n      </div>\n      <p>注意，有效 Unicode 标量值的最大值为 <code><span class=\"tok-number\">0x10ffff</span></code>。</p>\n      \n      <h4 id=\"Multiline-String-Literals\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#Multiline-String-Literals\">多行字符串字面量</a></h4>\n\n      <p>多行字符串字面量不处理转义，并且可以跨越多行。使用 <code><span class=\"tok-str\">\\\\</span></code> 标记开始一个多行字符串字面量。与注释类似，该字符串字面量持续到行尾；行尾本身不计入字符串。但是，如果下一行以 <code><span class=\"tok-str\">\\\\</span></code> 开头，就会追加一个换行符，并继续该字符串字面量。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">multiline_string_literals.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> hello_world_in_c =\n    <span class=\"tok-str\">\\\\#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-str\">\\\\</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-str\">\\\\int main(int argc, char **argv) {</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-str\">\\\\    printf(\"hello world\\n\");</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-str\">\\\\    return 0;</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-str\">\\\\}</span>\n;</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#embedFile\">@embedFile</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n      \n      <h3 id=\"Assignment\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#Assignment\">赋值</a></h3>\n\n      <p>使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span></code> 关键字为标识符赋值：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">constant_identifier_cannot_change.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> x = <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">foo</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 在文件作用域和函数内部都可以使用。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> y = <span class=\"tok-number\">5678</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 赋值之后，标识符不可再修改。</span>\n    y += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    foo();\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe constant_identifier_cannot_change.zig</kbd>\n<span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/constant_identifier_cannot_change.zig:8:5: </span><span class=\"sgr-31m\">error: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">cannot assign to constant\n</span>    y += 1;\n    <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^\n</span><span class=\"sgr-2m\">referenced by:\n    main: /home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/constant_identifier_cannot_change.zig:12:8\n    callMain [inlined]: /home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:788:64\n    callMainWithArgs [inlined]: /home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:729:20\n    posixCallMainAndExit: /home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:681:38\n    2 reference(s) hidden; use '-freference-trace=6' to see all references\n</span>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span></code> 适用于标识符直接寻址的全部字节。<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Pointers/#Pointers\">指针</a>具有独立的常量性。</p>\n      <p>需要可修改的变量时，使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span></code> 关键字：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">mutable_var.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> print = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).debug.print;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> y: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">5678</span>;\n\n    y += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"{d}\"</span>, .{y});\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe mutable_var.zig</kbd>\n$ <kbd>./mutable_var</kbd>\n5679\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>变量必须初始化：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">var_must_be_initialized.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>;\n\n    x = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe var_must_be_initialized.zig</kbd>\n<span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/var_must_be_initialized.zig:2:15: </span><span class=\"sgr-31m\">error: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">expected '=', found ';'\n</span>    var x: i32;\n              <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^\n</span>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <h4 id=\"undefined\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#undefined\">undefined</a></h4>\n\n      <p>使用 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span></code> 可以让变量保持未初始化状态：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">assign_undefined.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> print = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).debug.print;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span>;\n    x = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"{d}\"</span>, .{x});\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe assign_undefined.zig</kbd>\n$ <kbd>./assign_undefined</kbd>\n1\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p><code><span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span></code> 可以<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Type-Coercion\">强制转换</a>为任意类型。一旦转换，就无法再检测出该值原先是 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span></code>。<code><span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span></code> 表示该值可能是任何内容，甚至可能是不符合其类型含义的内容。用自然语言解释，<code><span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span></code> 的意思是“这不是有意义的值。使用它就是程序错误。该值将不会使用，或者在使用前会被覆盖”。</p>\n      <p>在 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#debug\">debug</a> 和 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#safe\">safe</a> 模式下，Zig 会向未定义内存写入 <code><span class=\"tok-number\">0xaa</span></code> 字节，以便尽早发现程序错误，并帮助调试器检测未定义内存的使用。但这仅是实现细节，不是语言语义，因此不保证代码可以观察到这种行为。</p>\n      \n\n      <h4 id=\"Destructuring\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#Destructuring\">解构</a></h4>\n\n      <p>解构赋值可以拆分可索引聚合类型中的元素，包括<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/struct/#Tuples\">元组</a>、<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Arrays/#Arrays\">数组</a>和<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Vectors/#Vectors\">向量</a>：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">destructuring_to_existing.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> print = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).debug.print;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> y: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> z: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> tuple = .{ <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span> };\n\n    x, y, z = tuple;\n\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"tuple: x = {}, y = {}, z = {}\\n\"</span>, .{x, y, z});\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> array = [_]<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>{ <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">6</span> };\n\n    x, y, z = array;\n\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"array: x = {}, y = {}, z = {}\\n\"</span>, .{x, y, z});\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> vector: <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@Vector</span>(<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>) = .{ <span class=\"tok-number\">7</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">8</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">9</span> };\n\n    x, y, z = vector;\n\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"vector: x = {}, y = {}, z = {}\\n\"</span>, .{x, y, z});\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe destructuring_to_existing.zig</kbd>\n$ <kbd>./destructuring_to_existing</kbd>\ntuple: x = 1, y = 2, z = 3\narray: x = 4, y = 5, z = 6\nvector: x = 7, y = 8, z = 9\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>解构表达式只能出现在块内，即不能位于<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Namespace/#Namespace\">命名空间</a>作用域。赋值左侧必须是逗号分隔的列表，其中每一项可以是左值（例如现有的 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span></code>）或变量声明：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">destructuring_mixed.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> print = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).debug.print;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> tuple = .{ <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span> };\n\n    x, <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> y : <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> z = tuple;\n\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"x = {}, y = {}, z = {}\\n\"</span>, .{x, y, z});\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// y 可变</span>\n    y = <span class=\"tok-number\">100</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可以使用 _ 丢弃不需要的值。</span>\n    _, x, _ = tuple;\n\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"x = {}\\n\"</span>, .{x});\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe destructuring_mixed.zig</kbd>\n$ <kbd>./destructuring_mixed</kbd>\nx = 1, y = 2, z = 3\nx = 2\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>解构前面可以添加 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span></code> 关键字，此时整个解构表达式在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>求值。所有声明的 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span></code> 都成为 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span></code>，所有表达式（包括结果位置和被赋值表达式）均在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>求值。</p>\n\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/struct/#Destructuring-Tuples\">元组解构</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Arrays/#Destructuring-Arrays\">数组解构</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Vectors/#Destructuring-Vectors\">向量解构</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n      \n      \n      ","translation":{"total":133,"translated":133}}
